      "created_at": "2015-02-12T17:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is no limit to how many games you can put in your pre-order. There is, however, a time limit on the pre-order - it will end on 12 March 2015.</p><p>The promos are only available through the pre-order, or from us in person at conventions. At conventions, however, you will have to pay for them (either with money or Sentinel Points).</p>",
